WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.503 --> 00:00:05.172
You captained your boat
all the way from Greenland.

00:00:05.756 --> 00:00:06.673
Who are you?

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.301
I'm Leif.

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:12.095
And why are you here?

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:15.641 position:58%
I want to see
if this fight you talk about is mine.

00:00:16.892 --> 00:00:17.893
Change is happening.

00:00:18.936 --> 00:00:20.395
And we must be ready.

00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:26.235
The Vikings

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:28.278
are still

00:00:29.363 --> 00:00:30.531
one people.

00:00:33.659 --> 00:00:36.411
Now is our time to make history.

